{
"file": 408,
"paths": [
"d008/d014/f016"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "7ade6943",
"en_raw": "Hey, look, look at this!"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "20e315f6",
"en_raw": "...The middle character"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "e13ca12f",
"en_raw": "It's the same character as Kurumi's"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "f024033d",
"en_raw": "Nao, what does this mean?"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "cc6c0d74",
"en_raw": "It means 'to stay'"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "5da364e9",
"en_raw": "Sun, stay, see..."
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "524fc0f0",
"en_raw": "Yes"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "35301a0d",
"en_raw": "To see the evening sun stay..."
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "7ac31697",
"en_raw": "That's why it's written Hirumi"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "dba084ac",
"en_raw": "...What's your name?"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "3715587b",
"en_raw": "What's your name?"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "30eca39b",
"en_raw": "Kurumi Shiina!"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "3afaf416",
"en_raw": "And the 'ru' in Kurumi~ is"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "17140818",
"en_raw": "this same character!"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "283ff664",
"en_raw": "Is that so"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "82e1f995",
"en_raw": "What an unusual name"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "07872856",
"en_raw": "Beauty that stays long..."
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "d114b78e",
"en_raw": "Still, it's a good name"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "8c30e16d",
"en_raw": "It suits you"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "767b0f2f",
"en_raw": "I used to like"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "a039b3f4",
"en_raw": "Hirumi too"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "5599fb7f",
"en_raw": "but since the mayor"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "81adeeb0",
"en_raw": "changed, well..."
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "a0d9ba9b",
"en_raw": "Hmm, Kurumi..."
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "c601d4e3",
"en_raw": "City planning, walking toward the sun brightly"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "837e69bc",
"en_raw": "...whatever that means"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "402ac351",
"en_raw": "it's certainly become"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "01666088",
"en_raw": "a hard town for old people..."
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "06e83e1e",
"en_raw": "I preferred the previous mayor"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "1e69cc30",
"en_raw": "I liked him better"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "82eadb55",
"en_raw": "I see, Kurumi..."
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "4b540301",
"en_raw": "When I was a child"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "4d635d7c",
"en_raw": "it was a more easygoing place"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "9bc1a91f",
"en_raw": "and the river water was clean"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "296492db",
"en_raw": "Oh yes, kingfishers"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "f628d41b",
"en_raw": "kids today wouldn't know them, would they?"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "4ba270a6",
"en_raw": "They used to be here"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "be84714e",
"en_raw": "Such a beautiful bird"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "27510d32",
"en_raw": "These days the feathers have dulled"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "835beb99",
"en_raw": "and all you see is egrets"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "37fa0ff1",
"en_raw": "You see, Kurumi..."
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "0e719874",
"en_raw": "Oh, the bus is here"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "7660e693",
"en_raw": "Well then"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "0826759e",
"en_raw": "I wonder when Granny will come"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "34fd803e",
"en_raw": "Wait / Go home  You see, Kurumi"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "dea50c15",
"en_raw": "wants to go somewhere else"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "f30b800a",
"en_raw": "Then, Kurumi"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "baa571e7",
"en_raw": "will wait for Granny!"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "455b4ebb",
"en_raw": "Not a bad idea"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "d8b37d58",
"en_raw": "for Shiina"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "52de0910",
"en_raw": "Maybe the old woman"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "f06eb7ed",
"en_raw": "has already left"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "2ca5854e",
"en_raw": "Looks like we came too late"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "ba5f19fa",
"en_raw": "Well, well"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "450b23d8",
"en_raw": "If it isn't Kurumi"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "6796f22c",
"en_raw": "We meet again"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "70fc9e25",
"en_raw": "Kurumi was waiting"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "4d9933e3",
"en_raw": "Oh, is that so"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "d56a8942",
"en_raw": "What do you need from me?"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "dcb5cac0",
"en_raw": "Do you need something from me?"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "82808a59",
"en_raw": "Kurumi"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "27c709d6",
"en_raw": "Kurumi came to look at graves"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "288e96b1",
"en_raw": "Look at blossoms?"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "6e6765cb",
"en_raw": "This year's cherry blossom viewing"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "7b1e83c7",
"en_raw": "is already over, you know"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "24f85291",
"en_raw": "I guess"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "52cb4547",
"en_raw": "...Huh?"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "78c87304",
"en_raw": "It was beautiful again this year"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "3739404f",
"en_raw": "No, no"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "a37e6727",
"en_raw": "Kurumi came to look at graves"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "7629af13",
"en_raw": "Graves are at the temple, aren't they?"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "e069b079",
"en_raw": "You don't go to look at graves"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "6df4acd9",
"en_raw": "you go to pay respects"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "24f85291",
"en_raw": "I guess"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "8ca0e361",
"en_raw": "...Huh?"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "31d9ac5a",
"en_raw": "Do you have incense?"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "3739404f",
"en_raw": "No, no"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "55c09760",
"en_raw": "Kurumi, you see..."
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "551ab996",
"en_raw": "it's not like that..."
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "6e6de332",
"en_raw": "not a grave, Hanako-san's..."
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "659dab8e",
"en_raw": "You see..."
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "ed265d32",
"en_raw": "Hey"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "f30685fb",
"en_raw": "You're big now"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "7adc04a6",
"en_raw": "so you should be more proper"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "f30c6b9b",
"en_raw": "Right?"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "c1fc05dd",
"en_raw": "Don't cause me trouble"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "bed76229",
"en_raw": "Here, I'll give you candy"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "d97ce204",
"en_raw": "Okay~"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "36db3627",
"en_raw": "Good girl, good girl, bye then"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "5c7f865c",
"en_raw": "...Hey, Shiina!"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "88895a30",
"en_raw": "Why say bye-bye there!"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "eeea2d35",
"en_raw": "Ah!"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "a8afa30a",
"en_raw": "Granny, Granny"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "dfe96884",
"en_raw": "Kurumi is looking for a grave"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "334bf8a0",
"en_raw": "Hanako-san's grave!"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "ebd75f16",
"en_raw": "There aren't any graves around here"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "fb74d41c",
"en_raw": "...Oh, right, right"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "6862f513",
"en_raw": "Not a grave, but"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "85ce4295",
"en_raw": "there's the Hime Grove"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "04bfa0dd",
"en_raw": "Not Hime Grove"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "f4ad5d7b",
"en_raw": "Hanako-san"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "15a77924",
"en_raw": "Not Hanako-san"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "82c7e1f2",
"en_raw": "it's the Hime Grove"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "8c6227f5",
"en_raw": "You know, there's the big hospital"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "342e195f",
"en_raw": "Go in on the road before it"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "7e35391a",
"en_raw": "and at the crossroads beyond"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "36bbde94",
"en_raw": "head toward the river"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "b5944258",
"en_raw": "Hime Grove?"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "a8273f0d",
"en_raw": "No, it's~"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "d8847112",
"en_raw": "Hanako-san's grave"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "15a77924",
"en_raw": "Not Hanako-san"
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "c286aed3",
"en_raw": "It's the Hime Grove"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "8c6227f5",
"en_raw": "You know, there's the big hospital"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "342e195f",
"en_raw": "Go in on the road before it"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "95145db0",
"en_raw": "and at the crossroads beyond, toward the river"
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "36bbde94",
"en_raw": "head toward the river"
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "ed99d5d3",
"en_raw": "I don't know the road ahead..."
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "b5bb2ada",
"en_raw": "For a walk, this is"
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "e7d20466",
"en_raw": "a bit too far"
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "c0e859da",
"en_raw": "If we go somewhere unfamiliar"
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "c1f8d9b5",
"en_raw": "we won't be able to get home"
}
]
}